      "created_at": "2021-01-03T16:30:50.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Even using the exact same Background, Power Source, and Archetype you can end up with heroes who may be considered stronger or weaker for combat mechanically. &nbsp; What you really are looking for is if the character appeals to your player. &nbsp;If it doesn't do that then it doesn't matter his strong they might be for combat.&nbsp;</p>",
