      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/c68b51/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2021-01-03T18:50:40.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>It is a bit funny that we see comments of two general types about character creation:</p>\n<p>1)&nbsp; Character creation doesn't create balanced characters.</p>\n<p>2)&nbsp; Going outside the guided or constructed methods, doing creation freeform, or swapping out Abilities, Powers, or Qualities, is bad because it creates unbalanced characters, or at least will make people think you're trying to.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
