      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/4491bb/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2021-01-03T21:18:49.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>That's because both are true.</p>\n<p>The Guided and Constructed&nbsp;methods might produce some heroes who are stronger&nbsp;than others, but all of the heroes they make are in a known range of power levels.</p>\n<p>Using the third&nbsp;method puts you potentially outside of that known range, even if you are within it in your eyes.</p>",
