      "id": 234624,
      "name": "Rabit",
      "username": "Rabit",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/{size}/7330_2.png",
      "created_at": "2021-01-04T21:25:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Also, keep in mind it's more than just the size of a single die. :-)</p>\n<p>If their die _pool_ has a collection of higher dice, they will be more powerful as they'll likely roll higher results. So if the power _and_ the quality _and_ the health die are higher, that implies they're \"stronger\" in that area/action.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>But yeah, it's really about the story we're trying to tell in our games more than who is better than whom. ;-)&nbsp;</p>",
